  "description": "Do-yeon, who grew up together with her Childhood Friends, Won-young and Won-hyuk.\n\nDo-yeon, who had been thinking about Won-hyuk since childhood, made a public confession to Won-hyuk on the middle school festival day, and was dumped.\n\nSlowly, the relationship between the three ends when the twins immigrate abroad a few months later, and the public confession case remains a dark history of their lives. After a while, Won-young, who returned to Korea without notice, appeared in front of Do-yeon and confessed...\n\n**Original Webtoon: (Expired)**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=3699972), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/52553548), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/content/home/05ai2ee8fb3e), [Bomtoon](https://bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/gg_SAI)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Indonesian](https://id.kakaowebtoon.com/content/Sahabat-atau-Cinta/477), [S.Chinese](https://m.ac.qq.com/comic/index/id/632490)",
